{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S06和S13的感受提示仍然偏密，连续上下扫读容易分散注意力；Y的左右分区在单独浏览叙事时更直观。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】突出每段叙事的关键转折和心理落点，观众即使边听边扫，也更容易迅速抓住发生了什么、人物为什么这样想。感受提示不仅更具体，还通过分阶段和到时出现的安排，把情绪变化、音乐动作与人物心理连接起来，尤其S03、S04、S07、S09和S12，前后因果及情绪转变比Y更容易被感知。X的主要代价是局部信息密度较高，但整体上，它让观众获得的不只是更多感受词，而是更清晰、更细腻且与音乐进程同步的体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6fd965fb-44c4-4a1a-94c4-1b6425778cd4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T210701284843Z", "elapsed_seconds": 56.468, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:07:57.769086+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2adf8d3f5661a2abeba554dd9d1620e2d18fcae3f38e6514ccaf5881e2372cf8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tool